{"1401630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stellar Wanderer DX", "steam_appid": 1401630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "You are a freelancer who just survived an assassination attempt on your client and yourself. Discover the universe, make new friends and new enemies, unravel interstellar plots, and fight in intense space battles! Follow the story, or explore the open galaxy at your own pace. As a pilot, you can travel star systems, fight hostiles, mine and trade resources, upgrade and customize your ship. The universe is your oyster! Prove your skills - be a fearless bounty hunter, a thriving merchant, a helpful ally, a respected racing champion, or even become the most dangerous outlaw in the galaxy. Adventure awaits among the stars!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/33c1fc896d2b2b6bedd92a4a4044ef0b.avif?t=1780816153\" alt=\"Thrilling Space Combat\" width=780 height=80 /></span><br>Engage in dangerous dogfights with rival factions, enemy armadas, ruthless pirates, and enigmatic aliens! Battle in third person, first person, and even cockpit view! Your victory will be the measure of your skills, tactics, and weapons arsenal. The combat offers a thrilling experience for every aspiring space warrior, whether you choose precision or raw firepower.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/a6743340e4c5be67b8565eeafef1ca98.poster.avif?t=1780816153\" aria-label=\"Third person view of a space dogfight\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/a6743340e4c5be67b8565eeafef1ca98.webm?t=1780816153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/a6743340e4c5be67b8565eeafef1ca98.mp4?t=1780816153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/00a72ceb39a7e38957b1557d4d397c41.avif?t=1780816153\" alt=\"Endless Customization and Upgrades\" width=780 height=80 /></span><br>Be a Fighter, Trader, Tank, or Engineer, each with its special ability and bonuses. Choose from over a dozen unique ships and customize each one with over 100 different weapons or devices. Upgrade your weapons, shields, or engine to dominate the battlefield. Equip additional equipment such as tractor beams, hidden compartments, or passenger cabins to thrive as an interstellar merchant.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/1fb549d7d6ed0f758ecceaf6a86b3540.avif?t=1780816153\" alt=\"Trade Your Way To Riches\" width=780 height=80 /></span><br>Trade, mine, or smuggle your way to riches as you travel between systems, each with its own economy, prices, and needs. Discover trade routes, mining spots, and even contraband! But be careful, the police don't appreciate illegal goods!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/318c4b1b5fdd0e8412d38a920b6ea6d7.poster.avif?t=1780816153\" aria-label=\"View of a menu with tradeable spaceship equipment\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/318c4b1b5fdd0e8412d38a920b6ea6d7.webm?t=1780816153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/318c4b1b5fdd0e8412d38a920b6ea6d7.mp4?t=1780816153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/f512b58386b7e59746ccf50878a76f93.avif?t=1780816153\" alt=\"Unleash Your Inner Explorer\" width=780 height=80 /></span><br>Set sail on your ship and navigate through a variety of space sets, each with several points of interest. Roam between safe, high-security systems, trade in the independent border worlds, or choose the danger of the pirate systems. Discover caches hidden in the deepest corners of the galaxy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/4f91029c79617a7e9eefa87d6ef57bbd.poster.avif?t=1780816153\" aria-label=\"A spaceship jumping out of a space gate\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/4f91029c79617a7e9eefa87d6ef57bbd.webm?t=1780816153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/4f91029c79617a7e9eefa87d6ef57bbd.mp4?t=1780816153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/b94b4b4f057b6f36b64e3035b28c1a3a.avif?t=1780816153\" alt=\"Experience a Rich Galactic Story\" width=780 height=80 /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a captivating story with 10 hours of gameplay and full voice acting (voices available in English only). Meet charismatic characters, uncover ancient secrets, and engage in the most epic space battles. The fate of mankind and the universe lies in your hands!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/b1ca5352673d7eaac219839e36564adc.avif?t=1780816153\" alt=\"Gorgeous Visuals\" width=780 height=80 /></span><br>Explore a beautiful universe filled with gorgeous retro-style visuals and unique atmospheric design. From the vastness of space to the bustling spaceports, from the asteroid fields to the intricate industrial installations, every detail is meticulously crafted to create a truly immersive experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/0f8283d473f6fb30647a0ac6546009c3.poster.avif?t=1780816153\" aria-label=\"Passing between two space cruisers in cockpit view\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/0f8283d473f6fb30647a0ac6546009c3.webm?t=1780816153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/0f8283d473f6fb30647a0ac6546009c3.mp4?t=1780816153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/773444d3eb91d4ede4aed801357ce65f.avif?t=1780816153\" alt=\"Get Rewarded in Side Missions\" width=780 height=80 /></span><br>Take on a variety of side missions at every space station. Hunt for bounties, escort friends through hostile territory, mine or deliver goods, and more! You can even race other pilots!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/f15a8cf451caaa93e514b49c1ac7e996.avif?t=1780816153\" alt=\"A New Deluxe Experience\" width=780 height=80 /></span><br>Stellar Wanderer DX features numerous improvements to its space systems, visuals, and gameplay, offering a new deluxe experience. Space systems have been rebuilt from scratch and expanded with new points of interest. Environments, ships, cockpits, and more have been reworked and improved with a higher level of detail. Various gameplay mechanics, controls, and settings have been tweaked to provide a better experience.<br>", "about_the_game": "You are a freelancer who just survived an assassination attempt on your client and yourself. Discover the universe, make new friends and new enemies, unravel interstellar plots, and fight in intense space battles! Follow the story, or explore the open galaxy at your own pace. As a pilot, you can travel star systems, fight hostiles, mine and trade resources, upgrade and customize your ship. The universe is your oyster! Prove your skills - be a fearless bounty hunter, a thriving merchant, a helpful ally, a respected racing champion, or even become the most dangerous outlaw in the galaxy. Adventure awaits among the stars!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/33c1fc896d2b2b6bedd92a4a4044ef0b.avif?t=1780816153\" alt=\"Thrilling Space Combat\" width=780 height=80 /></span><br>Engage in dangerous dogfights with rival factions, enemy armadas, ruthless pirates, and enigmatic aliens! Battle in third person, first person, and even cockpit view! Your victory will be the measure of your skills, tactics, and weapons arsenal. The combat offers a thrilling experience for every aspiring space warrior, whether you choose precision or raw firepower.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/a6743340e4c5be67b8565eeafef1ca98.poster.avif?t=1780816153\" aria-label=\"Third person view of a space dogfight\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/a6743340e4c5be67b8565eeafef1ca98.webm?t=1780816153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401630/extras/a6743340e4c5be6